<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Profil Arfa Jagara</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #0f172a;
            color: #f8fafc;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .profile-card {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            max-width: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid #334155;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .avatar {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #38bdf8, #3b82f6);
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto 15px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.4);
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #38bdf8;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .about {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .skills-section h2 {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #f1f5f9;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #334155;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .skill-item {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .skill-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .skill-name {
            font-weight: 500;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .skill-bar {
            background-color: #334155;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .skill-progress {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #38bdf8, #3b82f6);
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* Tingkat keahlian bisa disesuaikan di persentase width bawah ini */
        .mikrotik { width: 90%; }
        .linux { width: 85%; }
        .webserver { width: 88%; }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="profile-card">
        <div class="header">
            <!-- Inisial nama sebagai pengganti foto -->
            <div class="avatar">AJ</div>
            <h1>Arfa Jagara</h1>
            <p>Network & System Administrator</p>
        </div>

        <div class="about">
            Halo! Saya Arfa Jagara. Saya adalah seorang profesional di bidang teknologi jaringan dan administrasi server, dengan fokus keahlian pada konfigurasi infrastruktur jaringan dan pengelolaan server yang andal.
        </div>

        <div class="skills-section">
            <h2>Keahlian Utama</h2>
            
            <!-- Skill 1 -->
            <div class="skill-item">
                <div class="skill-info">
                    <span class="skill-name">MikroTik (Routing & Switching)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-bar">
                    <div class="skill-progress mikrotik"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Skill 2 -->
            <div class="skill-item">
                <div class="skill-info">
                    <span class="skill-name">Linux System Administration</span>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-bar">
                    <div class="skill-progress linux"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Skill 3 -->
            <div class="skill-item">
                <div class="skill-info">
                    <span class="skill-name">Web Server (Apache, Nginx, Hosting)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="skill-bar">
                    <div class="skill-progress webserver"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2026 Arfa Jagara. All Rights Reserved.
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
